---
---

<section class="w-full py-20 lg:py-28 bg-surface-container-low" id="opinie-pacjentow">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
    <!-- Header without AI kicker -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-14 gap-8 reveal">
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-on-surface font-normal leading-tight text-3xl lg:text-4xl">
          Zaufanie zbudowane na <span class="text-secondary font-semibold">trosce i rezultatach</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
          Ponad 1 850 zweryfikowanych opinii na portalach ZnanyLekarz i Google. Przeczytaj, jak pacjenci z Warszawy pokonali lęk i odzyskali uśmiech.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm border border-surface-container/60 shrink-0">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-sm" role="img" aria-label="Średnia ocen: 4.9 na 5 gwiazdek">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
          </div>
          <span class="font-bold text-sm text-on-surface mt-1">4.9 / 5.0</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">Średnia ocen</span>
        </div>
        <div class="h-8 w-px bg-surface-container"></div>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <span class="font-semibold text-xs text-on-surface">100% Certyfikowane</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">ZnanyLekarz &amp; Google</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Reviews Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-7">
      <!-- Review 1 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all border border-surface-container/60 card-lift flex flex-col justify-between reveal">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-xs" role="img" aria-label="Ocena: 5 na 5 gwiazdek">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-low text-secondary">
              Implantologia 3D
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface leading-relaxed italic">
            "Pan dr Czarnecki to wybitny specjalista. Bałem się zabiegu wszczepienia dwóch implantów przez ponad rok. Okazało się, że dzięki nawigacji komputerowej i znieczuleniu The Wand nie poczułem kompletnie nic! Następnego dnia poszedłem do pracy bez opuchlizny."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-surface-container-low flex items-center justify-between">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-secondary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs" aria-hidden="true">
              MK
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-semibold text-xs text-on-surface">Michał K.</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">Pacjent ZnanyLekarz • 2 tyg. temu</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-emerald-600 text-base" role="img" aria-label="Opinia zweryfikowana" title="Opinia zweryfikowana">verified</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 2 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all border border-surface-container/60 card-lift flex flex-col justify-between reveal">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-xs" role="img" aria-label="Ocena: 5 na 5 gwiazdek">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-low text-secondary">
              Licówki DSD
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface leading-relaxed italic">
            "Pani doktor Natalia Wiśniewska dokonała cudu z moim uśmiechem. Projekt Digital Smile Design pozwolił mi zobaczyć efekt przed podjęciem decyzji. Licówki wyglądają w 100% naturalnie, nikt nie wierzy, że to ceramika, a nie moje własne zęby. Dziękuję!"
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-surface-container-low flex items-center justify-between">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-secondary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs" aria-hidden="true">
              KD
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-semibold text-xs text-on-surface">Katarzyna D.</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">Pacjentka Google • miesiąc temu</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-emerald-600 text-base" role="img" aria-label="Opinia zweryfikowana" title="Opinia zweryfikowana">verified</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 3 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all border border-surface-container/60 card-lift flex flex-col justify-between reveal">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-xs" role="img" aria-label="Ocena: 5 na 5 gwiazdek">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true" style='font-variation-settings: "FILL" 1;'>star</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-low text-secondary">
              Mikroskop Zeiss
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface leading-relaxed italic">
            "W innej klinice powiedziano mi, że ząb nadaje się tylko do usunięcia. Doktor Piotr Morawski podjął się re-endo pod mikroskopem Zeiss i uratował go w trakcie jednej wizyty. Spokój, profesjonalizm i niesamowita troska. Poziom prawdziwie szwajcarski."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-surface-container-low flex items-center justify-between">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-secondary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs" aria-hidden="true">
              TW
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-semibold text-xs text-on-surface">Tomasz W.</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">Pacjent ZnanyLekarz • 3 tyg. temu</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-emerald-600 text-base" role="img" aria-label="Opinia zweryfikowana" title="Opinia zweryfikowana">verified</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
